hadiths[7]{hadithnumber,text}:
"178","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab tum mein se kisi ki biwi us se masjid jane ki ijazat mange to woh use na roke.'"
"179","[AI-translation] Ubayy ke aazad karda ghulam (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Abu Hurairah ek aurat se mile, to kaha: Tum kahan jana chahti ho? Us ne kaha: Masjid. Unhon ne kaha: Kya usi ke liye tum nikli ho ya usi ke liye tum ne khushbu lagai hai? Us ne kaha: Ji. Unhon ne kaha: Beshak main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: 'Jo aurat khushbu lagae phir masjid ke liye nikle, us ke liye aisa waisa [namaz] qabool nahin, aur na roza, yahan tak ke woh wapas jae aur janabat ke ghusl ki tarah ghusl kare.'"
"180","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Allah ki bandiyon ko Allah ki masjidon se na roko; aur woh niklen jabke woh khushbu lagaye baghair hon.' Abu Ja'far kehte hain: Yani khushbu lagaye baghair."
"181","[AI-translation] Abbad bin Tamim (Rahimahullah) se apne chacha [Abdullah bin Zaid Mazini Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko masjid mein chit lete hue dekha jabke Aap ne apna ek paon dusre par rakha hua tha. Abu Ja'far kehte hain: Abbad bin Tamim ke chacha Abdullah bin Zaid Mazini hain, Uhud ke din shaheed hone walon mein se ek; woh Abbad bin Tamim ke chacha aur un ki walida ke bhai hain."
"182","[AI-translation] Abbad bin Tamim (Rahimahullah) se apne chacha se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko masjid mein chit lete hue dekha jabke Aap ne apna ek paon dusre par rakha hua tha."
"183","[AI-translation] Abbad bin Tamim (Rahimahullah) se apne chacha se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko masjid mein chit lete hue dekha jabke Aap ne apna ek paon dusre par rakha hua tha. Abu Ja'far kehte hain: Abbad bin Tamim ke chacha Abdullah bin Zaid Mazini hain, Uhud ke din shaheed hone walon mein se ek; woh Abbad bin Tamim ke chacha aur un ki walida ke bhai hain."
"184","[AI-translation] Abbad bin Tamim (Rahimahullah) se apne chacha se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko masjid mein chit lete hue dekha jabke Aap ne apna ek paon dusre par rakha hua tha."
